{"id":"04016","root":"uni04016_1","name":{"ja":"フルフル","en":"Furfur"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"フルフル","en":"Furfur"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2026-10-28","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"魔族。アマハラにて情報屋として生業を行っている。\n長い時間を生きており、計り知れないほと豊富な知識を持っている。\n対魔忍だけではなく政界の者、魔族たちなど幅広く色々な者達を客として、様々な情報を売買している。情報屋としての活動のせいで、ノマドからは疎まれ、その命を狙われている。\n\n表で記されてはいないものの、その実力はノマドの魔界騎士・イングリッドと並ぶと噂されている。\n蟲にわずかな魔力を宿した「魔蟲」を自在に操ることを特技としている。","en":"They are a demon who works as an information broker in Amahara. They have lived for a long time and possess immeasurable, abundant knowledge. They trade information with a wide range of clients—not only Taimanin but also political figures and demons themselves. Because of their broker activities, they are shunned by the Nomads and have become a target. Though not recorded publicly, their power is rumored to be on par with the Nomad demon-realm knight Ingrid. Their specialty is manipulating \"Demon Insects,\" insects infused with a trace of magic, at will."},"illustrator":"遊丸(原案：Genyaky)","voiceActor":"古井とろ","forms":[{"id":"uni04016_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1646,3292],"sp":[200,200],"atk":[170,340],"def":[225,450],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","2530459"]},{"id":"uni04016_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2492,4984],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[240,480],"def":[350,700],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","2530459","2530460"]},{"id":"uni04016_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[3338,6676],"sp":[450,450],"atk":[310,620],"def":[475,950],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","2530459","2530460","2530461"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"